|---|---|---:|
| Spice Garden | Indian | 4.5 |
| Dragon Palace | Chinese | 4.2 |
| Pizza House | Italian | 4.1 |
| South Spice | South Indian | 4.7 |
| Burger Point | Fast Food | 3.9 |

*The output is illustrative and assumes these records exist in the database.*

